  "details": "The new Inflatable Pool and MEGABLASTER XTREME 1000 utilize the built-in contact tag \"Water\", allowing avatar makers to make custom interactions with these Items. The recent Photonic Slicer also has various useful tags assigned to it- namely \"Weapon\", \"Damage\", \"Damage Sharp\", and \"Fire\". \n\nHowever, the \"Portable Winterizer\" , \"Frosted Scribe\", and \"Winter Cheerizer\" are lacking the \"Cold\" and/or \"Freezer\" tags. On the Consumable side, the Marshmallow on a Stick, Grand Assortment, and Hanami Dango lack the \"Consumable\" or \"ConsumableFood\" tags, and the Flask of Effervescence similarly lacks the \"Consumable\" or \"Consumable Drink\" tags. \n\nIt seems unintended that these older items are missing their relevant tags, as consistent implementation would be immensely useful for avatar makers to create create custom interactions with Elemental and Consumable Items.",
